OL,3,GNEWSAUS techie builds 'plain English'
OL,4,Alocal plan website
OL,5,
OL,6,FA self-confessed American "tech nerd"
OL,7,Fhas created a website designed to make
OL,8,Fit easier for people to explore and
OL,9,Fcomment on a county's local plan.
OL,11,FSean Brannon, from Aylesbury,
OL,12,FBuckinghamshire, said he designed the
OL,13,Fonline site in an hour while travelling
OL,14,Fon a train.
OL,16,FHe said it was difficult to navigate
OL,17,Fthe official consultation site, and
OL,18,Fpeople have to overcome "too many
OL,19,Fbarriers" to comment on the plan.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
